        "PMC8282813::chunk::003::discussion::b590527e4b"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHEAs present a vast compositional design space.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::003::discussion::b590527e4b",
        "PMC8357793::chunk::001::introduction::0cf0f01e08"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The available pool of RHEAs remains unoptimized for the combined objectives of strength, ductility, and low density.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A data-driven inverse-design model can be trained on high-throughput experiments, CALPHAD outputs, and historical alloy data to predict promising RHEA compositions.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::003::discussion::b590527e4b"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed screening covers conditions representative of ambient- and elevated-temperature mechanical testing.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Parallel computational resources enable high-throughput evaluation of candidate compositions.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHEAs generally possess a body-centered-cubic solid-solution matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8357793::chunk::001::introduction::0cf0f01e08"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Targeted precipitate phases can be incorporated into the designed microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled local lattice distortions can be produced in the designed RHEAs.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting microstructure mediates enhanced strength, ductility, and reduced density.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Machine learning can learn correlations among composition, thermodynamic parameters, microstructure, and properties.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::003::discussion::b590527e4b"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The data-driven approach can efficiently navigate the vast HEA compositional space.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::003::discussion::b590527e4b",
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
